01:56:23.778 --> 01:56:25.778
Yes, maybe you have fallen back a little.

993
01:56:25.778 --> 01:56:28.778
And you know, I need to hold on to that grace of Jesus again.

994
01:56:28.778 --> 01:56:30.778
I need to come back to Him.

995
01:56:30.778 --> 01:56:32.778
Pray this with me as well.

996
01:56:32.778 --> 01:56:33.778
Shall we read it together?

997
01:56:33.778 --> 01:56:35.778
We will show it on the screen.

998
01:56:35.778 --> 01:56:36.778
Here we go.

999
01:56:36.778 --> 01:56:38.778
Thank you, Jesus.

1000
01:56:38.778 --> 01:56:41.778
I believe that you are the Son of God.

1001
01:56:41.778 --> 01:56:45.778
I believe that you died on the cross for my sin.

1002
01:56:45.778 --> 01:56:47.778
Forgive me all my mistakes.

1003
01:56:47.778 --> 01:56:50.778
I invite you into my life Jesus.

1004
01:56:50.778 --> 01:56:52.778
Give me a new start.

1005
01:56:52.778 --> 01:56:55.778
Help me to live for you.

1006
01:56:55.778 --> 01:56:58.778
From today on I am a child of God.

1007
01:56:58.778 --> 01:56:59.778
Amen.

1008
01:56:59.778 --> 01:57:00.778
Amen and amen.

1009
01:57:03.778 --> 01:57:06.778
Let’s sing this song together one more time.

1010
01:57:06.778 --> 01:57:09.778
With our eyes on the text we just read in the Bible.

1011
01:57:09.778 --> 01:57:12.778
Sing this song with that same conviction.

1012
01:57:12.778 --> 01:57:14.778
And then the service is over.

1013
01:57:14.778 --> 01:57:16.778
Tomorrow is prayer again.

1014
01:57:16.778 --> 01:57:18.778
Then we will see you tomorrow at half past seven.

1015
01:57:18.778 --> 01:57:19.778
Bye bye.

